          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Two independent pipelines — logs and metrics — plus security overlays, unified in Grafana
            and reachable only over the tailnet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Log pipeline -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <DiagramFrame tone="emerald" scroll={true} eyebrow="Pipeline 1" title="Logs — syslog-ng → Loki">
            <DiagramLane label="Senders" tone="emerald" cols={3} connector={true}>
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="🛡️" title="FortiGate" sub="udp/tcp :5514 · key=value" />
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="🐧" title="RFC3164" sub="udp/tcp :514" />
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="🐧" title="RFC5424" sub="tcp :601" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <DiagramLane label="Ingest — syslog-ng (native)" tone="emerald" cols={1} connector={true}>
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" variant="solid" icon="📥" title="syslog-ng"
                sub="tag source_type / app / host · JSON-escape · disk-buffer" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <DiagramLane label="Store" tone="emerald" cols={2} connector={true}>
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" variant="solid" icon="🗂️" title="Loki :3100" sub="HTTP push · low-cardinality labels · 30d" />
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="🧾" title="/var/log/remote" sub="raw file archive (redundant)" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <DiagramLane label="View" tone="emerald" cols={1}>
              <DiagramNode tone="teal" variant="solid" glow={true} icon="📊" title="Grafana" sub="Loki Explorer · FortiGate dashboards (LogQL logfmt)" />
            </DiagramLane>
          </DiagramFrame>
        </div>

        <!-- Metrics pipeline -->
        <div class="mt-10 reveal">
          <DiagramFrame tone="emerald" scroll={true} eyebrow="Pipeline 2" title="Metrics — Exporters → Prometheus">
            <DiagramLane label="Exporters (file-based SD)" tone="emerald" cols={3} connector={true}>
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="🖥️" title="node_exporter" sub="host CPU/mem/disk/net" />
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="📦" title="cAdvisor" sub="per-container" />
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" icon="🧮" title="Proxmox + edge" sub="targets/*.yml · hot reload" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <DiagramLane label="Scrape &amp; store" tone="emerald" cols={1} connector={true}>
              <DiagramNode tone="emerald" variant="solid" icon="⏱️" title="Prometheus :9090" sub="15s scrape · 30d / 40GB" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <DiagramLane label="Outputs" tone="emerald" cols={2}>
              <DiagramNode tone="amber" variant="solid" icon="🚨" title="Alertmanager :9093" sub="infra.yml rules → routing" />
              <DiagramNode tone="teal" variant="solid" glow={true} icon="📊" title="Grafana" sub="node + cluster dashboards" />
            </DiagramLane>
          </DiagramFrame>
        </div>

        <!-- Security overlays -->
        <div class="mt-10 reveal">
          <DiagramFrame tone="emerald" eyebrow="Overlays" title="Security — CrowdSec &amp; Wazuh">
            <DiagramLane label="Sources (read-only, over Tailscale)" tone="emerald" cols={2} connector={true}>
              <DiagramNode tone="red" icon="🧠" title="CrowdSec LAPI :6060" sub="cs_* metrics → Prometheus" />
              <DiagramNode tone="red" icon="🛰️" title="Wazuh indexer :9200" sub="OpenSearch · wazuh-alerts-4.x" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <DiagramLane label="Unified pane" tone="emerald" cols={1}>
              <DiagramNode tone="teal" variant="solid" glow={true} icon="📊" title="Grafana" sub="CrowdSec Overview · Wazuh SIEM (MITRE)" />
            </DiagramLane>
            <Fragment slot="legend">
              <span><span class="inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent align-middle mr-1.5"></span>Dashboards bound to the tailnet — nothing publicly exposed</span>
            </Fragment>
          </DiagramFrame>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-10">
          <p>
            <span class="text-slate-light">Heimdall</span> runs two independent pipelines. Logs flow
            through a native <span class="text-slate-light">syslog-ng</span> that tags each stream with
            low-cardinality labels and pushes to <span class="text-slate-light">Loki</span> over HTTP,
            while also writing a raw file archive as a redundant copy; FortiGate gets a dedicated port
            and its key=value logs are parsed at query time with LogQL. Metrics are pull-based:
            <span class="text-slate-light">Prometheus</span> scrapes node_exporter, cAdvisor, and the
            Proxmox and edge hosts via file-based service discovery, so adding a target is a file edit
            and a hot reload, with alerts routed through Alertmanager.
          </p>
          <p>
            Security telemetry rides alongside as read-only overlays — CrowdSec LAPI metrics into
            Prometheus and the Wazuh indexer as an OpenSearch datasource — so a single
            <span class="text-slate-light">Grafana</span> instance covers host health, cluster capacity,
            firewall traffic, and MITRE-mapped detections. Like the rest of the management plane, every
            piece of it is reachable only over Tailscale.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
